/E (You can either create your own safety plan or, if you know of anyone who can help you create a safety plan, you can also work with a trusted friend or helper. If you decide to work with someone, be extremely careful in ascertaining that they can be trusted. If you are living with an abuser, there may be people within your immediate circle \(be it family, friends, acquaintances or even people from amongst the house help\) who  act as enablers to the abuse.       )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
