317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (If you and the abuser are separated, yet you are forced to exchange custody of the children at designated intervals of time \(such as twice a week or month, etc.\) as per the orders of the court, be mindful of ensuring your safety and that of your children. Most cases of domestic violence turn fatal after the survivor has left the abuser. So be extremely vigilant and careful at all times. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Avoid exchanging custody of your children at your own home or the home of the abuser. You might not wish to divulge your current residential address to the abuser for reasons of safety. Instruct your children not to tell the abusive parent any details regarding your whereabouts or the location of your home for both your safety and their own. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Instead, try to meet at a safe place, in public. This could include a restaurant, the mall or the grocery story - or any other place where you are in full view of the public and the abuser will be unable to attack you or the children without being seen by witnesses. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Bring a trusted friend or family member along with you when you have to exchange custody. You could also have them exchange custody on your behalf. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Make sure that the abuser signs the affidavit ascertaining that custody has taken place according to the instructions of the court at each exchange. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (You could also try to schedule custody exchange\(s\) in a way in which your interaction with the abuser is minimized. One way could be to get the other parent to pick up the children from school at the end of the day after you drop them off in the morning, or vice versa, to eliminate the chances of seeing each other. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (It is also important that you plan for the emotional safety of yourself and your children. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
