/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Try to do a calming activity with your kids before the exchange takes place, in order to relax yourself and the children. It could also help you focus on something pleasant, such as going to the park for a quick walk before the exchange takes place. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
